@startuml
title 1번 슬라이드. JPA는 하나를 보지만 내부는 Read/Write로 나뉜다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #93C5FD
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Service / Repository\nDataSource를 직접 고르지 않음" as App #F8FAFC

rectangle "routingDataSource\nTransactionRoutingDataSource\n실제로 JPA가 바라보는 대상" as Routing #FEF3C7

rectangle "ReadWriteDataSourceAutoConfiguration\nwrite / read / routing DataSource 등록" as Auto #DBEAFE

rectangle "writeDataSource\nPrimary DB" as Write #FDE68A
rectangle "readDataSource\nReplica DB" as Read #DCFCE7

App --> Routing
Auto --> Routing
Auto --> Write
Auto --> Read
Routing --> Write
Routing --> Read

note bottom of Routing
애플리케이션은 routingDataSource 하나만 사용하고,
그 안에서 실제 Read/Write가 분리된다.
end note

note bottom of Read
read 설정이 없으면
write로 폴백 가능하다.
end note

@enduml
